<ModMetaData>
  <name>Toxin Warcasket</name>
  <author>Sam Hunt</author>
  <packageId>shunter.toxinwarcasket</packageId>
  <modVersion>1.4.0</modVersion>
  <description>Adds the Toxin, a 7th generation warcasket for Vanilla Factions Expanded - Pirates built for chemical warfare. The shell carries a tox gas tank that vents around the pilot, the shoulders spray it in a cone, and the helmet keeps it out and can draw it back in.

Requires Vanilla Factions Expanded - Pirates and Biotech. Compatible with Save Our Ship 2.</description>
